# Digital Storytelling: Effective Learning through the Internet.

**Authors:** Mellon, Constance A.

## Abstract
Defines digital storytelling, the application of multimedia techniques to the telling of stories. Describes how digital-storytelling assignments, designed to use an online conferencing facility, were developed for a college class. Provides examples of students' approaches to the personal narrative assignment. Discusses how to evaluate the digital-storytelling experience. (AEF)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ584341

